<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dark Knight Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Dark Knights' guild of Midgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name           Level   Up to
Dagger             0   80%
Fist               0   70%
Javelin            0   80%
Quarterstaff       0   60%
Hand Axe           1   90%
Short Sword        2   80%
Mace               3   100%
Rapier             4   100%
Club               5   60%
Broad Sword        8   100%
Falchion           8   60%
Whip               9   100%
Spear             10   100%
War Hammer        10   80%
Brass Knuckles    12   70%
Adze Mattock      14   90%
Flail             15   80%
Long Sword        15   100%
Battle Club       16   90%
Scimitar          16   100%
Battle Mace       18   100%
Crossbow          20   80%
Morning Star      20   80%
Scythe            20   60%
Lance             21   100%
Battle Axe        22   100%
Maul              24   80%
Claymore          25   100%
Great Sword       25   100%
War Mattock       25   100%
Bardiche          26   80%
Halberd           28   80%
</pre>
